This copy of the template has not been initialised.

.github/workflows/template-init.yml runs on the first push to the default
branch while this file exists: it fills the names into every file except
the workflows under .github/workflows/, which carry no placeholder because
GitHub's own token may not write them, creates the labels, opens the issue
"Set up this project", and deletes this folder. The workflow itself stays in
the tree and does nothing once this file is gone. Nothing else reads this
file.

In the template repository itself, tick "Template repository" under
Settings, General before the first push; until then the workflow would run
on the template and fill it.
